Package: hushkey
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: aignermax <https://github.com/aignermax>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, curl
Recommends: pipewire-bin, ydotool, wl-clipboard
Homepage: https://github.com/aignermax/hushkey
Description: local, offline push-to-talk dictation
 Hold a key, speak, release — the transcript is typed into whatever window
 has focus. Powered by faster-whisper; nothing leaves your machine after the
 one-time model download. X11 and Wayland supported.
 .
 The postinst script copies the sources into the installing user's
 ~/.local/share/hushkey and runs install.sh there (venv, dependencies,
 systemd user service). On Wayland it may ask for group membership in
 'input', which needs one logout.
